{"abstract":[{"text":"An action that opens a URL.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpenURLAction","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OpenURLAction","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"title":"OpenURLAction","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI0A9URLActionV","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/init(handler:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:)","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:completion:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SQ"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpenURLAction","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Read the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/openURL"},{"type":"text","text":" environment value to get an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance of this structure for a given "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment"},{"type":"text","text":". Call the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance to open a URL. You call the instance directly because it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defines a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method that Swift"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls when you call the instance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, you can open a web site when the user taps a button:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct OpenURLExample: View {","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openURL","","    var body: some View {","        Button {","            if let url = URL(string: \"https:\/\/www.example.com\") {","                openURL(url)","            }","        } label: {","            Label(\"Get Help\", systemImage: \"person.fill.questionmark\")","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to know whether the action succeeds, add a completion"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"handler that takes a Boolean value. In this case, Swift implicitly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:completion:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instead. That method calls your completion handler after it determines"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whether it can open the URL, but possibly before it finishes opening"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the URL. You can add a handler to the example above so that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it prints the outcome to the console:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["openURL(url) { accepted in","    print(accepted ? \"Success\" : \"Failure\")","}"],"syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system provides a default open URL action with behavior"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that depends on the contents of the URL. For example, the default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"action opens a Universal Link in the associated app if possible,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or in the user’s default web browser if not."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can also set a custom action using the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/View\/environment(_:_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view modifier. Any views that read the action from the environment,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"including the built-in ","type":"text"},{"code":"Link","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" views with markdown","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"links, or links in attributed strings, use your action. Initialize an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"action by calling the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/init(handler:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" initializer with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a handler that takes a URL and returns an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["Text(\"Visit [Example Company](https:\/\/www.example.com) for details.\")","    .environment(\\.openURL, OpenURLAction { url in","        handleURL(url) \/\/ Define this method to take appropriate action.","        return .handled","    })"],"syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftUI translates the value that your custom action’s handler","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns into an appropriate Boolean result for the action call.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For example, a view that uses the action declared above","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"receives ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" when calling the action, because the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"handler always returns ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result\/handled","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/openurlaction"]}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues/openURL":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/openurl","abstract":[{"text":"An action that opens a URL.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"openURL","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpenURLAction","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI0A9URLActionV"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/o